### Raiz
http://localhost:5220

# == SALAS ======================================

### Sala Cadastro
POST http://localhost:5220/salas
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Lab 3",
    "capacidade": 30,
    "tipo": "Laboratorio",
    "blocoId": 6
}

### Sala Listar
GET http://localhost:5220/salas

### Sala Buscar
GET http://localhost:5220/salas/1

### Sala Atualizar
PUT http://localhost:5220/salas/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Lab 3 - Redes",
    "capacidade": 35,
    "tipo": "Laboratorio",
    "blocoId": 1
}

### Sala Deletar
DELETE http://localhost:5220/salas/4
